WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.666
- [Narrator:] Eight months after winning the title,
the Rams are nowhere to be found.

00:00:03.666 --> 00:00:05.375
And now, Carrie Underwood.

00:00:05.375 --> 00:00:08.875
- ♪♪♪ Waitin' all night for morning time. ♪♪♪

00:00:08.875 --> 00:00:10.875
- Oh, what happened?

00:00:10.875 --> 00:00:14.083
- I went into the bathroom to Zac Yak, and there was a tiger in there.

00:00:14.083 --> 00:00:14.833
- What?!

00:00:15.041 --> 00:00:16.791
- It's just Who Dey.
- Look away.

00:00:16.791 --> 00:00:19.916
If you've seen one hangover, you've seen 'em all.

00:00:22.583 --> 00:00:24.291
- Has anyone seen Allen Robinson?

00:00:24.291 --> 00:00:26.666
I think you saved him from bears last night?

00:00:26.666 --> 00:00:29.833
- How long have we been out? And whose records are these?!

00:00:29.833 --> 00:00:32.666
- We need to get back into contention before it's too late.

00:00:33.708 --> 00:00:34.958
- I'll catch up with you later.

00:00:35.916 --> 00:00:36.541
- Found Allen!

00:00:36.541 --> 00:00:39.166
- That's Cooper Kupp. You're looking for a different receiver.

00:00:39.166 --> 00:00:40.416
- I have other receivers?

00:00:40.416 --> 00:00:43.166
- How much could possibly happen during one party?

00:00:43.166 --> 00:00:44.541
- [Matthew Stafford:] F--k them pics.

00:00:44.541 --> 00:00:47.333
- You guys lost to something called Cooper Rush?

00:00:47.333 --> 00:00:48.541
- You did first.

00:00:48.541 --> 00:00:50.291
- Y'all, I think I know how to fix this.

00:00:52.541 --> 00:00:53.666
I wanna go for two.

00:00:53.666 --> 00:00:55.833
- You have 19, Coach.

00:00:55.833 --> 00:00:57.958
- Don't worry, guys. I found a few easy games!

00:00:57.958 --> 00:01:01.583
- Where's the last place anyone would expect to find Allen?

00:01:01.583 --> 00:01:02.916
- What the hell, man?!

00:01:02.916 --> 00:01:04.916
- Is that Allen?
- You piece of—

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:10.750
-I tend to think of myself as a one-man Zac Pack.

00:01:10.750 --> 00:01:14.125
And then we drafted Burrow, and there were two of us in the Zac Pack.

00:01:14.125 --> 00:01:17.333
Um, and then we lost to y'all, in that big ol' game.  

00:01:17.333 --> 00:01:19.125
We were like-
-Stop, coach.

00:01:19.125 --> 00:01:20.041
It's played out.

